                <p>[The public deposits m the Bank of England during 1878, owing to the war
                    troubles, were somewhat smaller than usual. I should say that they averaged 25
                    to 30 per cent. less than usual. But I selected 1878 as the latest whole
                    year.—G. McH.]</p>
                <table cols="2" rows="4">
